* User-supplied LM301A candidate; not verified manufacturer model.
* Ports: +IN -IN V+ V- OUT COMP1 COMP2.
* WARNING: input stage polarity, compensation transfer and output drive
* require independent verification before replacing the RC4558.
.subckt LM301A 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
q1 11 2 13 qin
q2 12 1 14 qin
rc1 3 11 5.305k
rc2 3 12 5.305k
re1 13 15 2.45k
re2 14 15 2.45k
iee 15 4 16u
ree 15 0 12meg
cee 15 0 1.5p
cin 1 2 3p
ga 6 0 11 12 188.5u
r2 6 0 100k
gb 7 0 6 0 140
ro2 7 0 7.14m
ec 18 0 7 0 1
rout 18 5 75
d1 5 19 dlim
d2 20 5 dlim
vlim1 3 19 1.6
vlim2 20 4 1.6
.model qin NPN(IS=800e-18 BF=125)
.model dlim D(IS=1e-14)
.ends LM301A
